{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# gl(4) L=2: untwisting the FSoV norm -- GENERAL twists, no LR restriction\n\nCompanion to `SU4_norm_untwisting_L2.wb`, which handled the LR-symmetric su(2)-sector\ncase. Here nothing is restricted: `Q1, Q2, Q^3, Q^4` are four independent solutions,\nand the twists satisfy only unimodularity `z1 z2 z3 z4 = 1` (the reference notebook's\n`phi4 = -phi1-phi2-phi3`).\n\n**Twist parametrisation.** The four blocks of the `4L x 4L` matrix carry exponentials\n`e^((phi_j - phi_k) u)` with `j in {1,2}`, `k in {3,4}`. The staged untwisting of the\nLR case (`phi1 -> 0` first) generalises to killing the `(1,4)` block's twist, i.e.\n`delta = phi1 - phi4 -> 0`. So we use\n\n```\nphi1 = -(phi2+phi3)/2 + delta/2 ,   phi4 = -(phi2+phi3)/2 - delta/2\n```\n\nwith `phi2, phi3, delta` free (unimodularity automatic). Step 1 is `delta -> 0`;\nstep 2 is `phi2, phi3 -> 0`. On the LR locus (`phi3 = -phi2`) this reduces to\n`phi1 = delta/2`, `phi4 = -delta/2`, i.e. exactly the earlier `phi1 -> 0`.\n\n**Normalisation.** Eq. (12) of the paper assumes `z1 z4 = z2 z3 = 1`. The general\nstatement is Appendix L (L1), which carries an extra prefactor\n`Prod_{j<k} z_jk^(lambda_j - lambda_k)`. That is an overall scalar: it shifts the\noverall power of the untwisting limit but does not affect which rows degenerate or\nwhat rotation is needed. We compute the (12) determinant and report the prefactor\nseparately.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- A1. General twists: only unimodularity z1 z2 z3 z4 = 1 ---- *)\nClearAll[h, zz, th, Qth, ThSum, chi, tau, BaxP, dBaxP, solveQsGen, c, cd, J1, J2, J3];\nh = I;\nth[_] := 0;\nzz[4] := 1/(zz[1] zz[2] zz[3]);\nchi[1] := Sum[zz[i], {i, 4}];\nchi[2] := Sum[zz[i] zz[j], {i, 1, 4}, {j, i + 1, 4}];\nchi[3] := Sum[zz[i] zz[j] zz[k], {i, 1, 4}, {j, i + 1, 4}, {k, j + 1, 4}];\nchi[4] := zz[1] zz[2] zz[3] zz[4];\nQth[L_][u_] := Product[u - th[a], {a, L}];\nThSum[L_] := Sum[th[k], {k, L}];\n\ntau[1][L_, {M_, S_, Nn_}][u_] := u^L chi[1] +\n   u^(L - 1) ((-h L + h M - ThSum[L]) zz[1] + (-h L - h M + h S - ThSum[L]) zz[2] +\n              (h Nn - h S - ThSum[L]) zz[3] + (-h Nn - ThSum[L]) zz[4]) +\n   Sum[J1[b] u^(b - 1), {b, 1, L - 1}];\ntau[2][L_, {M_, S_, Nn_}][u_] := u^(2 L) chi[2] +\n   u^(2 L - 1) ((-3 h L + h S - 2 ThSum[L]) zz[1] zz[2] +\n                (-2 h L + h M + h Nn - h S - 2 ThSum[L]) zz[1] zz[3] +\n                (-2 h L - h M + h Nn - 2 ThSum[L]) zz[2] zz[3] +\n                (-2 h L + h M - h Nn - 2 ThSum[L]) zz[1] zz[4] +\n                (-2 h L - h M - h Nn + h S - 2 ThSum[L]) zz[2] zz[4] +\n                (-h L - h S - 2 ThSum[L]) zz[3] zz[4]) +\n   Sum[J2[b] u^(b - 1), {b, 1, 2 L - 1}];\ntau[3][L_, {M_, S_, Nn_}][u_] := u^L chi[3] +\n   u^(L - 1) ((-2 h L + h Nn - ThSum[L]) zz[1] zz[2] zz[3] +\n              (-2 h L - h Nn + h S - ThSum[L]) zz[1] zz[2] zz[4] +\n              (-h L + h M - h S - ThSum[L]) zz[1] zz[3] zz[4] +\n              (-h L - h M - ThSum[L]) zz[2] zz[3] zz[4]) +\n   Sum[J3[b] u^(b - 1), {b, 1, L - 1}];\n\n(* Q_i(u) = zz[i]^(-I u) p_i(u)  =>  Q_i(u + a h) = zz[i]^(-I u) zz[i]^a p_i(u + a I) *)\nBaxP[L_, cfg_][z_, p_][u_] :=\n    z^2 p[u + 2 I] Qth[L][u] Qth[L][u - I]\n  + z^(-2) p[u - 2 I] Qth[L][u] Qth[L][u + I] chi[4]\n  - z^1 p[u + I] Qth[L][u - I] tau[1][L, cfg][u + I]\n  + p[u] tau[2][L, cfg][u + I]\n  - z^(-1) p[u - I] Qth[L][u + I] tau[3][L, cfg][u + I];\n(* Q^k(u) = zd^(+I u) pd(u)  =>  Q^k(u + a h) = zd^(I u) zd^(-a) pd(u + a I) *)\ndBaxP[L_, cfg_][zd_, p_][u_] :=\n    zd^2 p[u - 2 I] Qth[L][u] Qth[L][u + I]\n  + zd^(-2) p[u + 2 I] Qth[L][u] Qth[L][u - I] chi[4]\n  - zd^1 p[u - I] Qth[L][u + I] tau[1][L, cfg][u]\n  + p[u] tau[2][L, cfg][u + I]\n  - zd^(-1) p[u + I] Qth[L][u - I] tau[3][L, cfg][u + 2 I];\n\nSimplify[chi[4]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"687575\" data-output-id=\"0\" data-out-n=\"16\" data-sub-idx=\"18\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"1\" data-sub-start=\"46\" data-sub-end=\"46\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[16]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"19\" data-latex-b64=\"MQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[16]= 1",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "283e6ce7-33b2-4d1d-a04f-f6977f662a9e"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- A2. General (non-LR) exact solver: the reference notebook's solveQs ----\n   Q_i = zz[i]^(-I u) p_i,  deg p_i = exps[[i]] = {M, S-M, L+Nn-S, L-Nn}\n   Q^4 = zz[4]^(+I u) pd_4, deg pd_4 = Nn ;  Q^3 = zz[3]^(+I u) pd_3, deg pd_3 = S-Nn\n   Four Baxter equations + two dual Baxter equations, solved exactly.\n   Solve returns branches containing Sqrt of a perfect square; derad resolves them\n   (this is what the reference notebook's PowerExpand does). *)\nClearAll[solveQsGen, derad];\nderad[expr_] := Simplify[expr /. Sqrt[x_] :> PowerExpand[Sqrt[x]]];\nsolveQsGen[L_, {M_, S_, Nn_}] := solveQsGen[L, {M, S, Nn}] = Module[\n  {exps, expds, pf, pdf, vars, eqs, sols},\n  exps = {M, S - M, L + Nn - S, L - Nn}; expds = {Nn, S - Nn};\n  If[Min[exps] < 0 || Min[expds] < 0, Return[{}]];\n  pf[i_] := Function[uu, Evaluate[uu^exps[[i]] + Sum[c[k][i] uu^k, {k, 0, exps[[i]] - 1}]]];\n  pdf[4] := Function[uu, Evaluate[uu^Nn + Sum[cd[k][4] uu^k, {k, 0, Nn - 1}]]];\n  pdf[3] := Function[uu, Evaluate[uu^(S - Nn) + Sum[cd[k][3] uu^k, {k, 0, S - Nn - 1}]]];\n  vars = Join[Table[J1[b], {b, L - 1}], Table[J2[b], {b, 2 L - 1}], Table[J3[b], {b, L - 1}],\n              Flatten@Table[c[k][i], {i, 4}, {k, 0, exps[[i]] - 1}],\n              Table[cd[k][4], {k, 0, Nn - 1}], Table[cd[k][3], {k, 0, S - Nn - 1}]];\n  eqs = Flatten@Join[\n     Table[CoefficientList[Expand@Together@BaxP[L, {M, S, Nn}][zz[i], pf[i]][u], u], {i, 4}],\n     {CoefficientList[Expand@Together@dBaxP[L, {M, S, Nn}][zz[4], pdf[4]][u], u],\n      CoefficientList[Expand@Together@dBaxP[L, {M, S, Nn}][zz[3], pdf[3]][u], u]}];\n  sols = Solve[Thread[Numerator[Together[eqs]] == 0], vars];\n  Association[\"cfg\" -> {M, S, Nn}, \"L\" -> L, \"exps\" -> exps, \"expds\" -> expds,\n     \"p\" -> Table[derad[pf[i][u] /. #], {i, 4}],\n     \"pd\" -> {derad[pdf[3][u] /. #], derad[pdf[4][u] /. #]}] & /@ sols];\n\n(* validation: on the LR locus z3 = 1/z2 (hence z4 = 1/z1) the {0,1,0} state must\n   reproduce the paper's (P1): p1 = 1, p2 = u + I(z1 + z2^2)/((z1-z2)(1+z2)) *)\nsolGen010 = solveQsGen[2, {0, 1, 0}];\nlrLocus = {zz[3] -> 1/zz[2]};\np2paper = u + I (zz[1] + zz[2]^2)/((zz[1] - zz[2]) (1 + zz[2]));\n{Length[solGen010], Simplify[(#[\"p\"][[2]] /. lrLocus) - p2paper] & /@ solGen010}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"687575\" data-output-id=\"1\" data-out-n=\"23\" data-sub-idx=\"8\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"2\" data-sub-start=\"32\" data-sub-end=\"32\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[23]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"19\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:82.48em;vertical-align:-40.99em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:41.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-43.49em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:22.79em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:22.79em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:40.99em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:41.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-43.49em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:22.79em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:20.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.366em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:20.616em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.358em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:20.616em;\"></span><span style=\"height:18.616em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"18.616em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 18616\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V18616 H384z M384 0 H504 V18616 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-20.616em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:20.616em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-21.758em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:20.616em;\"></span><span style=\"height:18.616em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"18.616em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 18616\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V18616 H384z M384 0 H504 V18616 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-40.366em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:20.616em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:20.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:20.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.366em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:20.616em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.358em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:20.616em;\"></span><span style=\"height:18.616em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"18.616em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 18616\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V18616 H384z M384 0 H504 V18616 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-20.616em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:20.616em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-21.758em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:20.616em;\"></span><span style=\"height:18.616em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"18.616em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 18616\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V18616 H384z M384 0 H504 V18616 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-40.366em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:20.616em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:20.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:20.79em;\"><span style=\"top:-9.6099em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:12.4498em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\" style=\"color:gray;\"><span class=\"mopen\" style=\"color:gray;\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\" style=\"color:gray;\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.95em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.95em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.4em;\"></span><span style=\"color:gray;width:0.667em;height:5.400em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.667em\" height=\"5.400em\" viewBox=\"0 0 667 5400\"><path d=\"M403 1759 V84 H666 V0 H319 V1759 v1800 v1759 h347 v-84\nH403z M403 1759 V0 H319 V1759 v1800 v1759 h84z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.45em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:black;\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.902em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.902em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.354em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:black;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:black;\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"color:black;\">zz</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"color:black;margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\" style=\"color:black;\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"color:black;top:0em;\"><span style=\"color:black;\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:black;\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"color:black;top:0em;\"><span style=\"color:black;\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"color:black;margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"color:black;margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:black;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:black;\"><span class=\"minner\" style=\"color:black;\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"color:black;top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\" style=\"color:black;\"><span style=\"color:black;\">(</span></span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:black;\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"color:black;\">zz</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"color:black;margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\" style=\"color:black;\"><span class=\"minner\" style=\"color:black;\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"color:black;top:0em;\"><span style=\"color:black;\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:black;\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"color:black;top:0em;\"><span style=\"color:black;\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\" style=\"color:black;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"color:black;\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"color:black;margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\" style=\"color:black;\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"color:black;margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:black;\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"color:black;top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\" style=\"color:black;\"><span style=\"color:black;\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.354em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.6029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\" style=\"color:black;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"color:black;\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"color:black;margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"color:black;margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\" style=\"color:black;\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"color:black;top:0em;\"><span style=\"color:black;\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:black;\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"color:black;\">zz</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"color:black;margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\" style=\"color:black;\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"color:black;top:0em;\"><span style=\"color:black;\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:black;\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"color:black;top:0em;\"