ght:20.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:20.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.366em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:20.616em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎭</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.358em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:20.616em;\"></span><span style=\"height:18.616em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"18.616em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 18616\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V18616 H384z M384 0 H504 V18616 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-20.616em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:20.616em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎬</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-21.758em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:20.616em;\"></span><span style=\"height:18.616em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"18.616em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 18616\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V18616 H384z M384 0 H504 V18616 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-40.366em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:20.616em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎫</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:20.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:40.99em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
