      {
       "data": "Out[23]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{2,\\left\\{\\frac{\\textcolor{gray}{\\left[\\textcolor{black}{\\begin{gathered}\n  \\mathrm{i}\\,\\mathrm{zz}\\left(2\\right)\\, \\\\\n  \\left(-\\mathrm{zz}\\left(2\\right)\\,\\mathrm{zz}\\left(1\\right)^{11}+\\left(\\mathrm{zz}\\left(2\\right)^2+1\\right)\\,\\mathrm{zz} \\right. \\\\\n  \\left. \\left(1\\right)^{10}+3\\,\\mathrm{zz}\\left(2\\right)\\,\\mathrm{zz}\\left(1\\right)^9 \\right. \\\\\n  \\left. -4\\,\\left(\\mathrm{zz}\\left(2\\right)^2+1\\right)\\,\\mathrm{zz}\\left(1\\right)^8-2\\,\\mathrm{zz}\\left(2\\right)\\,\\mathrm{zz} \\right. \\\\\n  \\left. \\left(1\\right)^7+6\\,\\left(\\mathrm{zz}\\left(2\\right)^2+1\\right)\\,\\mathrm{zz}\\left(1\\right)^6-2\\,\\mathrm{zz} \\right. \\\\\n  \\left. \\left(2\\right)\\,\\mathrm{zz}\\left(1\\right)^5-4\\,\\left(\\mathrm{zz}\\left(2\\right)^2+1\\right)\\,\\mathrm{zz}\\left(1\\right)^4 \\right. \\\\\n  \\left. +3\\,\\mathrm{zz}\\left(2\\right)\\,\\mathrm{zz}\\left(1\\right)^3+\\left(\\mathrm{zz}\\left(2\\right)^2+1\\right)\\,\\mathrm{zz} \\right. \\\\\n  \\left. \\left(1\\right)^2-\\mathrm{zz}\\left(2\\right)\\,\\mathrm{zz}\\left(1\\right)-\\mathrm{zz} \\right. \\\\\n  \\left. \\left(2\\right)\\,\\sqrt{\\frac{\\mathrm{zz}\\left(1\\right)^2\\,{\\left(\\mathrm{zz}\\left(1\\right)^2-1\\right)}^8\\,{\\left(\\mathrm{zz}\\left(2\\right)\\,\\mathrm{zz}\\left(1\\right)^2-\\left(\\… [latex truncated: 3535 chars total]",
