  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- A3. High-precision numeric solver (the reference notebook's NSolve route) ----\n   Symbolic Solve returns branches with Sqrt of perfect squares that resist PowerExpand;\n   NSolve at high working precision is the reference notebook's own approach, and it is\n   what we use for the untwisting limits.\n   General twist parametrisation, unimodular, with delta = phi1 - phi4 the step-1 knob:\n     phi1 = -(p2+p3)/2 + delta/2,  phi2 = p2,  phi3 = p3,  phi4 = -(p2+p3)/2 - delta/2\n   On the LR locus p3 = -p2 this gives phi1 = delta/2, phi4 = -delta/2. *)\nClearAll[eqSys, solveNumAt, phiOf, zsub];\n\neqSys[L_, {M_, S_, Nn_}] := eqSys[L, {M, S, Nn}] = Module[{exps, pf, pdf, vars, eqs},\n  exps = {M, S - M, L + Nn - S, L - Nn};\n  pf[i_] := Function[uu, Evaluate[uu^exps[[i]] + Sum[c[k][i] uu^k, {k, 0, exps[[i]] - 1}]]];\n  pdf[4] := Function[uu, Evaluate[uu^Nn + Sum[cd[k][4] uu^k, {k, 0, Nn - 1}]]];\n  pdf[3] := Function[uu, Evaluate[uu^(S - Nn) + Sum[cd[k][3] uu^k, {k, 0, S - Nn - 1}]]];\n  vars = Join[Table[J1[b], {b, L - 1}], Table[J2[b], {b, 2 L - 1}], Table[J3[b], {b, L - 1}],\n              Flatten@Table[c[k][i], {i, 4}, {k, 0, exps[[i]] - 1}],\n              Table[cd[k][4], {k, 0, Nn - 1}], Table[cd[k][3], {k, 0, S - Nn - 1}]];\n  eqs = Flatten@Join[\n     Table[CoefficientList[Expand@Together@BaxP[L, {M, S, Nn}][zz[i], pf[i]][u], u], {i, 4}],\n     {CoefficientList[Expand@Together@dBaxP[L, {M, S, Nn}][zz[4], pdf[4]][u], u],\n      CoefficientList[Expand@Together@dBaxP[L, {M, S, Nn}][zz[3], pdf[3]][u], u]}];\n  {vars, Numerator[Together[eqs]], exps, {pf[1][u], pf[2][u]}, {pdf[3][u], pdf[4][u]}}];\n\nphiOf[{p2_, p3_, del_}] := {-(p2 + p3)/2 + del/2, p2, p3, -(p2 + p3)/2 - del/2};\nzsub[pars_] := Table[zz[i] -> Exp[I phiOf[pars][[i]]], {i, 3}];\n\nsolveNumAt[L_, cfg_, pars_, wp_: 60] := Module[{sy, sb, sols},\n  sy = eqSys[L, cfg]; sb = zsub[pars];\n  sols = NSolve[Thread[(sy[[2]] /. sb) == 0], sy[[1]], WorkingPrecision -> wp];\n  Association[\"J\" -> (sy[[1]] /. #), \"p\" -> (sy[[4]] /. #), \"pd\" -> (sy[[5]] /. #),\n              \"pars\" -> pars, \"phi\" -> phiOf[pars]] & /@ sols];\n\n(* sanity: {0,1,0} on the LR locus must reproduce the paper's (P1) numerically *)\ntstPars = {1/7, -1/7, 2/3};\ntst = solveNumAt[2, {0, 1, 0}, tstPars, 60];\np2ref = With[{z1 = Exp[I phiOf[tstPars][[1]]], z2 = Exp[I phiOf[tstPars][[2]]]},\n   u + I (z1 + z2^2)/((z1 - z2) (1 + z2))];\n{Length[tst], Min[Table[N[Norm[CoefficientList[Expand[s[\"p\"][[2]] - p2ref], u]], 12], {s, tst}]]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"687575\" data-output-id=\"2\" data-out-n=\"32\" data-sub-idx=\"10\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"3\" data-sub-start=\"37\" data-sub-end=\"37\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[32]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"19\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRcezIsMFxyaWdodFx9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
