  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- B1. General FSoV norm, independent Q^3, Q^4 ----\n   Q_j(u)  = Exp[ phi_j u] p_j(u)      (j = 1,2)   since z^(-I u) = Exp[phi u]\n   Q^k(u)  = Exp[-phi_k u] pd_k(u)      (k = 3,4)   since z^(+I u) = Exp[-phi u]\n   entry(alpha,j,k,beta,a,b) = < Q_j^[a] u^(beta-1) Q^k[b] >_{L,alpha}\n   block twist exponential = Exp[(phi_j - phi_k) u]. *)\nClearAll[brk, rowsIdx, colsIdx, mkMat, mkQ12, mkQ34, mkBnorm, LL];\nLL = 2;\nbrk[f_, ell_, alpha_] := Module[{g},\n  g = Exp[2 Pi u (alpha - 1)] f/((u + I/2)^ell (u - I/2)^ell);\n  2 Pi I/(-2 Pi)^alpha (Residue[g, {u, I/2}] + Residue[g, {u, -I/2}])];\nrowsIdx = Flatten[Table[{alpha, j, k}, {alpha, LL}, {j, 1, 2}, {k, 3, 4}], 2];\ncolsIdx = Flatten[Table[{beta, a, b}, {beta, LL}, {a, {1, -1}}, {b, {1, -1}}], 2];\n\n(* st: association with \"p\" = {p1,p2}, \"pd\" = {pd3,pd4}, \"phi\" = {phi1..phi4} *)\nQup[st_, j_] := Exp[st[\"phi\"][[j]] u] st[\"p\"][[j]];\nQdn[st_, k_] := Exp[-st[\"phi\"][[k]] u] st[\"pd\"][[k - 2]];\nmkMat[st_] := Table[\n   brk[(Qup[st, rr[[2]]] /. u -> u + cc[[2]] I/2) u^(cc[[1]] - 1) *\n       (Qdn[st, rr[[3]]] /. u -> u + cc[[3]] I/2), LL, rr[[1]]],\n   {rr, rowsIdx}, {cc, colsIdx}];\nmkQ12[st_, uu_] := (Qup[st, 1] /. u -> uu + I/2) (Qup[st, 2] /. u -> uu - I/2)\n                 - (Qup[st, 1] /. u -> uu - I/2) (Qup[st, 2] /. u -> uu + I/2);\nmkQ34[st_, uu_] := (Qdn[st, 3] /. u -> uu + I/2) (Qdn[st, 4] /. u -> uu - I/2)\n                 - (Qdn[st, 3] /. u -> uu - I/2) (Qdn[st, 4] /. u -> uu + I/2);\nmkBnorm[st_] := Det[mkMat[st]]/(mkQ12[st, -I/2] mkQ34[st, I/2])^(2 LL);\n\n(* continuation: follow one state as the twist parameters move, matching on J *)\nClearAll[pickNear];\npickNear[sols_, Jref_] := First@SortBy[sols, Norm[N[#[\"J\"] - Jref]] &];\n\n(* cross-check: on the LR locus this must reproduce the LR notebook's value -0.027431652822 *)\nlrPars = {1/7, -1/7, 2/3};\nlrSols = solveNumAt[2, {0, 1, 0}, lrPars, 60];\nN[mkBnorm[#], 15] & /@ lrSols",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
